    "title": "Eight storylines to watch as Clash kicks off 2026 season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Neil Paine ,\n4 hours ago As the Cup Series heads to Bowman Gray Stadium in Winston-Salem, North Carolina, for the Cook Out Clash, the 2026 NASCAR season is finally upon us. While the exhibition race event won’t pay any points, it will give us a chance to see all of the new faces in new cars (or new paint schemes) driving around a track in live action for the first time this year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
